WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Guile approaches crouching Zangief with raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.200
Standing medium punch hits from the Rush.

3
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.700
Crouching medium punch follows the standing medium.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.200
Crouching light punch links before the first Boom.

5
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.700
Perfect light Sonic Boom hits the crouching target.

6
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.200
Back heavy punch follows the first Boom.

7
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.000
The second Perfect light Sonic Boom hits.

8
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Standing heavy kick completes this seven-hit conversion.

9
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Zangief remains grounded after the heavy-kick finish.
